secubox-annuaire (0.2.2-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * fix(#768): durable wg-mesh nft allow for the :8799 federation listener.
    postinst inserts `iifname wg-mesh ip saddr 10.10.0.0/24 tcp dport 8799
    accept` BEFORE the terminal drop in /etc/nftables.conf on vortex-firewall
    nodes (table inet secubox_filter) so it survives reboot — a rule appended
    after the drop is dead. Idempotent; guarded to mesh nodes; validated with
    `nft -c` and reverted on failure. Legacy `inet filter` hubs (broad 10/8
    accept) are skipped. Closes the cross-node gap where gk2 could not pull a
    peer's /log/export after the peer rebooted.

