secubox-annuaire (0.1.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release — Annuaire-Miroir trust substrate.
    - annuaire/verbs.py: auto_add / invite / accept_invite / propose / vote /
      tally / revoke / emancipate — the four protocols from spec §3.
    - annuaire/model.py, crypto.py, log.py, resolver.py: BLAKE2b-chained
      SQLite-WAL journal + Ed25519 signing + can() resolver (pre-existing core).
